---

This repository vendors third-party code under scripts/vendor/. Each vendored
file keeps its upstream licence; see scripts/vendor/README.md.

Allocator and application sources are fetched at build time and are NOT
redistributed here. Their licences are recorded in allocators/allocators.toml
and reproduced in the build metadata of every result.
